WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.010
‎This story is a work of fiction. The names of all of the characters, organizations, and so on
are imaginary. It also bears no connection to any specific real-life events.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:37.720
Lady Loulan.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.200
It seems the resurrection medicine

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.160
was actually an experiment during
the development of an immortality elixir.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:00.660
In fact, Suirei was brought back to life
with that medicine.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.750
The previous apothecary
really was skilled.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:07.590
But what Shenmei wants
is an immortality drug

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.340
that makes you look ten years younger

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.670
with just one dose.

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.600
You've got it rough too.

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:22.770
No such medicine exists.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.940
I know that...

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.900
But even I have my pride as an apothecary!

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.510
The days just keep slipping by.

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.640
Wait for me!

00:02:58.220 --> 00:02:59.140
Young master!

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:01.470
How many times have I told you
not to go that way?

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:03.020
It's fine, who cares!

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.310
Getting scolded again, huh?

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:10.610
He gets dragged back every time,
but he never gets tired of it.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.610
And this smell...

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.280
Is there a workshop down below?

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.070
Like in that hidden village.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.000
I hope nothing explodes.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:32.000
Hmm?

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.050
Wire?

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.970
"Run. The guard will be lured away."

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:43.220
Run? But where to?

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:47.640
- Let me go!
- Hey! Young master!

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.230
Was this your doing?

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.320
"Lured away"?

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.610
Hey.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:02.200
Episode 45: Taibon

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.450
What are you up to?

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:05.580
What do you mean?

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.000
Did you put them up to this?

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.420
No idea what you mean.

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:15.090
He was trying to help me
in his own childish way.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.800
It might've been naive,

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.390
but if we got caught, it'd be serious.

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:25.810
I was just playing.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.390
And while I was at it,
I checked if the guards were slacking off.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:31.810
- Is that true?
- Yes.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.940
Do not do anything suspicious again.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.490
- Got it!
- Wait, but I'm sure.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.030
Do not cause any more fuss.

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:43.530
You understand?

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.950
Fine.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:51.920
I'm glad Suirei was there.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.590
- All's well that ends well.
- Oh my?

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.470
What is all this commotion?

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:04.220
Mother.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:11.600
Mother.

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:14.110
It is nothing serious.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.730
Really?

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:18.070
Then why is the apothecary outside?

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.990
I wonder.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:21.030
Kyou-u was playing

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:24.160
in front of the apothecary's room
and interfering with the guard.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:26.620
Just in case, I was asking about that.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.660
Oh dear,

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:31.250
did you do something bad?

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:32.790
That's not good.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:35.840
If you do not behave,

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.630
I might have to

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:40.470
spank you a little, hmm?

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.340
Lady Shenmei, that is...

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.260
What?

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.600
Kyou-u is still a child.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.600
And it really was not

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.150
anything serious.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.410
So someone made a big fuss

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:07.870
over something trivial,
is that what you're saying?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.660
No way! That's not true!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.790
But doesn't it seem that way?

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.380
The water prison
should give him time to think.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:19.000
- No!
- This is absurd.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.800
The reason doesn't matter.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.760
She just enjoys

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.470
making others suffer.

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:28.930
It has nothing to do with me.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:32.350
I should leave the guard and Kyou-u alone.

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:35.350
But,

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.230
it pisses me off.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:39.020
It cannot be helped.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:42.030
Then let us punish both of them.

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:43.530
You damn hag.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:46.160
What?

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:50.410
You little brat!

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.040
That was dumb.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.130
I asked him to.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.840
I asked that child to help me escape.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:10.100
It was my request.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:11.970
You!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.270
This apothecary is no good.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.690
Let us teach her a lesson.

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:20.820
Throw her in the water prison!

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.360
In this cold? Water?

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.570
I really should've kept quiet.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:30.160
Then we'll lose another apothecary.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.870
Oh my, Suirei.

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:35.040
Did I hear something?

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.290
Must be my imagination.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.960
Lady Shenmei!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:40.000
You must not act on your own.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:42.800
I apologize.

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:44.590
But--

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:58.350
Even noble blood is worthless

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:01.860
once it's tainted.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.150
Maybe

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.740
Suirei feels responsible in her own way.

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:12.280
I never intended to bring you this far.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.830
Another fool, huh?

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:19.290
Mother.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:22.250
- I want to use that.
- That?

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.010
You mean Taibon.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:29.680
Taibon?

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.930
I've heard of that before.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:36.310
Brilliant idea. Why not try it?

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.770
It worked perfectly last time.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.530
What now?

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:49.110
Take the apothecary with you.

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:02.630
This way.

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:11.510
What is this room?

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:14.890
No hard feelings.

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:17.060
You helped me,

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.680
but this is Lady Shenmei's order.

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.240
Taibon.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.200
That's right. I remember.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:40.910
A cruel execution method

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.710
used by a mad king in ancient times.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:46.460
A hole would be dug,
and the criminal confined within.

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:48.750
And inside it were...

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:54.470
No wonder. Suirei's afraid of snakes.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:03.730
Just kidding.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:06.110
How adorable.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:13.240
What the hell?

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:15.410
What is that?

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:17.530
Smells kinda... toasty?

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.120
Smells good.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:29.960
What are you doing?

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.130
Do you have any salt?

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:38.510
Of course I don't! And hey, is that?

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:39.850
Snake.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.850
Let's pretend it's fish.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.610
But seriously, how did you even?

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.860
I butchered it with a hairpin
and roasted it over a torch.

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:54.200
You're seriously okay with that?

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:57.740
Snakes and bugs move slowly
before hibernation.

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:01.620
Just in case,
I killed any venomous ones first

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.750
and turned my herbs into ash

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.830
- for insect repellent.
- Was there even

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.460
a point in me coming here?

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:11.170
So, what do you need from me?

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.970
Suirei and the kid
asked me to help you out.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:17.300
Said to give you a hand.

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:19.050
That kid

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:21.680
even gave me a jade hair ornament.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.930
Thanks to you,

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:26.350
we didn't get punished.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.560
They did that?

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:32.650
Man, I'm done with this place.

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:34.360
I saw a smoke signal outside.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.990
It means a punitive force
is coming from the capital.

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:40.240
The whole fortress is in chaos.

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.200
- That's how I was able to sneak in.
- Huh? This smell.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.200
I'm leaving now.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:49.130
If you're planning on running,
don't take the stairs on the other side.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:52.040
They're making gunpowder in the basement.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:53.050
Gunpowder.

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:55.010
There are a lot of people down there.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.470
- If it explodes, you'll get caught in it--
- Thank you!

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:00.140
Got it. The opposite stairs!

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.560
I warned you, okay!

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:24.660
So that smell was from there.

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:28.210
It really is gunpowder.

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:30.620
But this smoke,

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:33.130
they'll get poisoned like this.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:34.380
Using fire near gunpowder?

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:37.050
That's insane.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:39.050
Oh no.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.090
That is...

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:48.230
Leave this place immediately!

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:51.190
What's wrong, Milady?

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:54.270
The punitive force will be here
any moment.

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.400
This fortress will become
a battlefield and fall.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:59.200
You must escape before that!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:02.950
Silver!

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:06.450
Waah!

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.330
Waah!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:11.330
Yes!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:12.830
Yeah!

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.670
M... Milady?

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:15.840
You too, hurry!

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:21.510
Do your best to get out!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:24.970
Get out of here!

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.100
Are you serious?

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:52.960
This is bad!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:55.880
Loulan.

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:02.760
Loulan!

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:07.010
Huh! Maomao, what are you doing here?

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:09.270
I should be asking you that.

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:12.640
Are you hurt?

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:15.150
I figured you'd be fine with the Taibon.

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:16.940
I knew it.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:20.280
It was delicious.

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.110
That makes no sense.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:27.580
Not coming from someone
who eats bugs on purpose.

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:28.580
Hey!

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:34.620
Let's get out of the fortress.
The punitive force is coming.

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.170
We have to go now.

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:42.800
I am not going.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.180
I still have things to do.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.860
You're coming with me?

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.820
You could still escape.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:04.820
I know I'm being foolish.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.740
If my mother finds out,
it will be terrifying.

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:10.160
If I get away with just a whipping,
I'll be lucky.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:14.160
I thought you were being treated
with care.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.210
Mother barely even

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:23.260
remembers what I look like.

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:26.510
Ever since I can remember,

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:29.430
I was made up with rouge and powder.

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:33.310
To Mother, I'm just a doll.

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.600
A cute doll

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:38.440
who always obeys.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:40.730
So...

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:43.400
Oh, sister!

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:46.320
- You again?
- I want to help too!

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:48.410
I want to be with you, sister!

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.280
What are you slacking off for?

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:53.660
M... Mother?

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.040
Bring the tea at once!

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:01.090
She did not even

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.550
recognize me in maid clothes.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:05.760
She hit me with a fan across the cheek.

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:08.300
When I dressed as a maid,

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:10.300
I was just another servant to her.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:14.060
And yet, you still went to see Suirei.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:17.350
Because I wanted to be close to her.

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:23.270
She was always being tormented by Mother.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.070
I think her mother died

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.400
from being tormented by mine.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:33.370
When Father took Suirei in,

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.410
Mother flew into a rage,

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:38.290
hair disheveled,

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:41.880
screaming, "Will you mock me
across two generations?"

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:44.840
"That daughter's nothing
but a shameless whore."

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:48.220
It was like hell.

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:51.220
Two generations.

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.720
By the time

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:56.520
I was sent back as a gift,

00:16:57.100 --> 00:17:00.020
my mother and I
were already by Father's side.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:02.860
Even noble blood is worthless

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:06.030
once it's tainted.

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:09.400
Suirei. Could she be?

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:12.700
Have you never heard the rumors?

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:15.330
About the woman

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:17.750
who bore the previous emperor's

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:20.250
first child and was then
separated from her?

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:23.290
I think she died last year, right?

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:26.920
Yes. That woman was Sister's grandmother.

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:28.920
Her name was Taihou.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:32.800
She used to be an attendant
when my mother was in the inner palace.

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:35.850
I knew it.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:37.680
And

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:41.560
Sister's mother was the daughter of Taihou
and the physician

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.480
who was exiled from the palace.

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:46.690
So Suirei has

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:49.070
royal blood running through her veins.

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:53.240
I heard she liked ghost stories.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.910
One of them nearly
choked me to death once.

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:59.580
Maybe that was her grandmother's doing.

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:05.250
After all, I'm my mother's daughter.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:08.050
She must have hated me.

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:11.800
Hated me enough to want to kill me,
even as a ghost.

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:14.680
Who knows if ghosts even exist?

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:17.010
That sounds like you.

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:23.850
Mother married Father just to

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:25.940
give birth to me, Loulan.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:29.070
It was only for revenge.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:33.110
Father has Western blood,

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.240
same as the Queen Mother.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:38.870
So,

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.160
Loulan's eyes...

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:48.210
"You will be the new Queen Mother,"

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.300
she always told me.

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:53.220
Hey.

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:57.510
Loulan or Shisui.

00:18:58.390 --> 00:19:01.180
I do not even know
what to call you anymore,

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.640
But...

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.020
But...

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:12.730
Shisui.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.200
What is it?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:29.250
The abortifacient ingredients
that were circulating in the rear palace.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.710
Did you have some?

00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:32.920
To use on yourself?

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:37.430
That ghost story you told me before,

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:40.140
the one where the bell cricket's wife
eats her husband.

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:43.890
Were you talking about yourself?

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:48.600
Comparing yourself to an insect
trapped in a cage called "nobility,"

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:52.320
doomed to bear a child
and devour the emperor,

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:56.360
but you were afraid of that fate.

00:19:57.950 --> 00:19:59.160
The lantern plant.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:00.910
I know.

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:04.700
Maomao, you are so sharp.

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.750
I am glad I brought you here.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.380
Seriously, you toss and turn too much.

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:28.770
They are not breathing.

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:30.900
What?

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:36.610
You gave them

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:38.740
poison?

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.090
Medicine.

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:01.720
What I did was already extreme enough.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.800
The whole family will be slaughtered.

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:05.640
You can see it coming.

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:10.850
I mixed it in sweet juice
and gave it to them

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:13.900
after we looked at picture scrolls.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:18.860
One of the girls cried,
saying she wanted to sleep with her mom.

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:21.240
But she could not.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:23.450
Their mothers were

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.950
all close with mine.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:31.960
The reason Kyou-u came late

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:35.920
was because he was trying to
rescue you, Maomao.

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:40.590
That boy, maybe he knew.

00:21:49.730 --> 00:21:51.310
He bit his lip,

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:55.190
and drank it all in one go.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:06.200
Why did you bring me here?

00:23:46.060 --> 00:24:00.950
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:57.940 --> 00:24:00.950
Next episode: The Forbidden Army

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:00.930
